# Artifact integrity: this repository publishes a SHA256 manifest and frozen
# criteria files whose hashes are recorded inside the verdict JSONs that they
# govern. Any end-of-line conversion would change file bytes and break both
# checks, so line-ending conversion is disabled repository-wide.
#
# With `-text`, Git stores and checks out exactly the bytes it was given, on
# every platform. Do not replace this with `* text=auto`.
* -text
